tract.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/kg-v1-node-edge-posture-contract.validator-result.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/kg-v1-node-edge-posture-contract.readback.md`\n- `scripts/method-map/build-kg-v1-node-edge-posture-contract.mjs`\n- `scripts/method-map/__tests__/kg-v1-node-edge-posture-contract.test.js`\n\n## Count and posture invariants\n- Real 9709 question rows: 3530\n- Visual-required rows: 858\n- SourceVisualReceipt accepted rows: 159\n- Visual terminal blocker rows: 699\n- Student-display eligible visual rows: 0\n- `blocked_quarantined` and `blocked_research_only` map categorically to `method_diagnosis_suppressed`.\n- Method confidence controls diagnostic strength/review routing only, not question availability.\n- Rights/display remains separate from visual QA and SourceVisualReceipt replay.\n\n## Boundaries preserved\n- No import implementation.\n- No production DB schema or migration.\n- No frontend/UI wording change.\n- No remote Supabase mutation.\n- No external VLM calls.\n\n## Validation\n- `node --check scripts/method-map/build-kg-v1-node-edge-posture-contract.mjs`\n- `node --experimental-vm-modules /home/samsen/code/ciecopilot-home/node_modules/jest/bin/jest.js --rootDir /home/samsen/.worktrees/ciecopilot-home/cie-667 --runInBand --runTestsByPath scripts/method-map/__tests__/kg-v1-node-edge-posture-contract.test.js` - PASS, 4 tests\n- `node scripts/method-map/build-kg-v1-node-edge-posture-contract.mjs` - validation status: pass\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` - warning only for branch naming/ahead state; worktree clean; report/artifact guard healthy","created_at":"2026-07-05T07:26:59Z","updated_at":"2026-07-05T07:35:24Z","closed_at":"2026-07-05T07:35:24Z","merged_at":"2026-07-05T07:35:24Z","merge_commit_sha":"49f1a2e71f74f3f18fc6a4bb6753558d3f1287c3","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-